flowchart LR
    U[Balance Designer / Operator] --> UI[Streamlit UI]
    UI --> O[Agent Orchestrator]
    O <--> L[OpenAI LLM\nResponses or Chat Completions]
    O --> X[ToolExecutor\ntimeout / count / validation / trace]
    X --> T[16 callable analysis tools]
    T --> D[(5 CSV DataFrames\nmatch / character / skill / item / patch)]
    T --> R[Structured tool results]
    R --> O
    O --> OUT[Analysis / virtual patch candidate\nscenario estimate / reflection]
    OUT --> H{Human Review Gate}
    H -->|approve candidate / reject / revise / retest| P[(SQLite authoritative log\nCSV and JSON mirrors)]
    H -. no automatic live patch .-> STOP[Internal review and QA]
